      "title": "GSP Crop Science Limited Announces Management Changes",
      "body": "GSP Crop Science Limited had, at its board meeting held on May 26, 2026, approved the re-designation of Mr. Shail Jayesh Shah (DIN: 07543594) from Whole Time Director and Chief Financial Officer (CFO) designated as Executive Director- Finance and CFO to Whole Time Director designated as Executive Director- Strategy and Corporate Affairs with effect from June 1, 2026. Mr. Shail Jayesh Shah ceased to be Chief Financial Officer of the Company with effect from close of business hours on May 31, 2026, and continued as Whole-Time Director designated as Executive Director - Strategy and Corporate Affairs. Mr. Shail Jayesh Shah is the Whole-Time Director designated as an Executive Director and Chief Financial Officer of Company. He holds a bachelor's degree in commerce from H.L Institute of Commer",
